{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026zBEx1K9WSm1793537439.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>四川一名女遊客今年五月，在景區玩高空項目時撞崖身亡。事發近半年，當局公布有兩名涉事負責人，被移送司法機關處理。</p><p></p><p>事發在今年五一黃金周期間，該名女遊客在玩「瀑布鞦韆」時，因工作人員未有正確操作設備，加上現場缺乏防護措施，令遊客急墜並撞向瀑布岩壁，送院後不治。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ACCIDENT-2000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20265mAE7PuUEL1793537578.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>四川省華鎣市政府指，經調查後確認事故是一宗因營運企業管理不足，未有效辨識管控安全風險、違規安排未經培訓的職員工作、屬地政府監管不力等，而導致的事故。目前兩名事故責任人已移送司法機關處理，調查中發現的公職人員履職問題，已移交有關機關追責問責。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ACCIDENT-2000_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026t2oaaQ6I2b1793537650.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:17.974789+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":249,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T12:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T10:18:20.669042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T01:20:49.051469+00:00","content_hash":"d1eeb498dabbab317fc596d374f5f0f2c59a56969204d85b2a59e42260aa320f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T01:26:17.974789+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}